### Access Previous Delta Table Version (Rust)

Source: https://github.com/delta-io/delta-rs/blob/main/docs/usage/appending-overwriting-delta-lake-table.md

Loads a specific previous version of a Delta table using Rust. This allows for time travel to inspect historical data.

```rust
let delta_path = Url::from_directory_path("/tmp/some-table").unwrap();
let mut table = open_table(delta_path).await?;
table.load_version(1).await?;
```

