### Inspect Partition Data Counts in Rust

Source: https://github.com/delta-io/delta-rs/blob/main/docs/usage/optimize/small-file-compaction-with-optimize.md

Queries the number of data files per partition in a Delta table using Rust and Apache Arrow DataFusion. This helps identify partitions ready for optimization.

```Rust
let table = open_table(observation_data_path_url).await?;
    let batch = table.snapshot()?.add_actions_table(true)?;
    let ctx = SessionContext::new();
    ctx.register_batch("observations", batch.clone())?;
    let df = ctx.sql("    SELECT \"partition.date\",
            COUNT(*)
    FROM observations
    GROUP BY \"partition.date\"
    ORDER BY \"partition.date\"    ").await?;
    df.show().await?;
```

